                    {
                        "sense_id": "8ac1320d-5aec-3101-a90d-3eec12728a79",
                        "entry_id": "62441330-4b57-337b-88ee-16177b1d6acb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eiwit dat de werking van lichaamsvreemde stoffen zoals virussen, bacteriën of grote moleculen opheft"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bde34eb7-f35a-447b-a76c-599c71aa151a",
                                "sense_id": "8ac1320d-5aec-3101-a90d-3eec12728a79",
                                "text": "De strategie heeft in elk geval een negatief effect gehad op het aantal sterfgevallen van het land. Met 43 sterfgevallen per 100.000 inwoners is het sterftecijfer van Zweden wereldwijd een van de hoogste en uit een eerste Zweedse studie naar groepsimmuniteit blijkt dat slechts 7,3 procent van de Stockholmers antistoffen tegen Covid-19 heeft opgebouwd. In veel Europese landen stabiliseert het aantal doden en besmettingen, in Zweden blijft de curve doorlopen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "929d9dd4-e3d1-4c71-8063-ef4a4bb588a4",
                        "source_entry_id": "62441330-4b57-337b-88ee-16177b1d6acb",
                        "source_sense_id": "8ac1320d-5aec-3101-a90d-3eec12728a79",
                        "target_lang_word": "antibody",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antibody",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7b3d295-17f4-32f9-92f2-34cf51b205f1",
                                        "entry_id": "5b7de57f-c261-39bc-86a6-6cc8965be341",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A protein produced by B-lymphocytes that binds to a specific antigen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15ba18e2-0abe-4a3a-bb9e-8423af6e1a1c",
                                                "sense_id": "b7b3d295-17f4-32f9-92f2-34cf51b205f1",
                                                "text": "It’s estimated only 0.1% of antibodies circulating in the bloodstream enter the brain – this also includes the therapeutic antibodies currently used in clinical trials. An approach my team is taking is to use ultrasound to temporarily open the blood-brain barrier, which increases the uptake of Alzheimer’s drugs or antibody fragments."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7446ff39-54ba-45b8-ac32-0bdefb9ed917",
                        "source_entry_id": "62441330-4b57-337b-88ee-16177b1d6acb",
                        "source_sense_id": "8ac1320d-5aec-3101-a90d-3eec12728a79",
                        "target_lang_word": "immunoglobulin",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "immunoglobulin",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74c82d10-c361-33f9-b7b1-100ee15614f2",
                                        "entry_id": "39a8e95f-0453-3919-9e6d-54d55e33bc1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of the glycoproteins in blood serum that respond to invasion by foreign antigens and that protect the host by removing pathogens; an antibody."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d69d0573-1cbf-4ac4-ba90-32b782ae35de",
                                                "sense_id": "74c82d10-c361-33f9-b7b1-100ee15614f2",
                                                "text": "The recent observation that a heat labile human immunoglobulin, IgE , could mediate the release of both histamine and SRS-Aᵐᵒⁿᵏᵉʸ from primate lung slices (Ishizaka et al., 1969), prompted a re-examination of the biologic activity of rat heat labile homocytotropic antibody."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
